{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape the pit with your plungers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing to freedom as a determined rooster named 'Cluck Norris', using only a pair of plungers to lunge and swing your way upwards. Precision and timing are crucial; one wrong move can send you back to the start, making each leap a test of skill and patience. Can you conquer the pit and reach the top? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826970/extras/945aa4974be5b2d0999e12823166821e.poster.avif?t=1772743861\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826970/extras/945aa4974be5b2d0999e12823166821e.webm?t=1772743861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826970/extras/945aa4974be5b2d0999e12823166821e.mp4?t=1772743861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun, physics-based plunger grappling mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully designed levels that get harder the higher you climb.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging yet deeply rewarding gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange world with mysteries to uncover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmosphere that pulls you in.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore diverse biomes with unique challenges!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a variety of biomes, each presenting unique obstacles and increasing difficulty. Every environment tests your plunging skills in new ways. Adapt to the changing landscapes and prove your mastery across all terrains. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826970/extras/902129a4f23dad8faa7d0282b8ccd798.poster.avif?t=1772743861\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826970/extras/902129a4f23dad8faa7d0282b8ccd798.webm?t=1772743861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826970/extras/902129a4f23dad8faa7d0282b8ccd798.mp4?t=1772743861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet NPCs and uncover the mysteries!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the eccentric residents of the coop - each with quests, gossip, or questionable life choices. Help them out (or don\u2019t) and maybe you\u2019ll discover why this place feels\u2026 off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826970/extras/27a05fd5a2f87e867e7d83123e66201b.poster.avif?t=1772743861\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826970/extras/27a05fd5a2f87e867e7d83123e66201b.webm?t=1772743861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826970/extras/27a05fd5a2f87e867e7d83123e66201b.mp4?t=1772743861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join the community!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subscribe to the <strong>Youtube</strong> channel for an in-depth look into the game's development with devlogs and other video content.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the <strong>Discord</strong> if you wanna get an even closer look at the development of the game and provide feedback, bug reports or just simply lurk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Check social links on the right side of this page!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2826970?t=1772743861","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2826970?t=1772743861","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826970/c20926370d4a11133bf59a6284f3195df8bf86b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772743861","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826970/c20926370d4a11133bf59a6284f3195df8bf86b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772743861","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2917950,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape the pit with your plungers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing to freedom as a determined rooster named 'Cluck Norris', using only a pair of plungers to lunge and swing your way upwards. Precision and timing are crucial; one wrong move can send you back to the start, making each leap a test of skill and patience. Can you conquer the pit and reach the top? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826970/extras/945aa4974be5b2d0999e12823166821e.poster.avif?t=1772743861\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826970/extras/945aa4974be5b2d0999e12823166821e.webm?t=1772743861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826970/extras/945aa4974be5b2d0999e12823166821e.mp4?t=1772